# CEN26A-01-88101 Hall Clinker reference-driven CAD acceptance assembly.
# The adjacent DESIGN_PREPARATION.md records given, derived, assumed and open data.
# This is not an independently checked structural design or construction release.
REQUIRES ICAD 1.0
REQUIRES CAPABILITY PARAMETER_EXPRESSIONS_V1
REQUIRES CAPABILITY QUALIFIED_VALUE_REFERENCES_V1
REQUIRES CAPABILITY ASSEMBLY_OCCURRENCES
REQUIRES CAPABILITY MANUFACTURING_CONNECTIONS_V1
REQUIRES CAPABILITY MATERIAL_PROFILE_V1
REQUIRES CAPABILITY CALCULATED_BILINGUAL_BOM_V1
REQUIRES CAPABILITY MAGNETIC_INTERFACE_SNAP_V1
REQUIRES CAPABILITY VISUAL_JSON_V1
PROJECT hall_clinker_cen26a_01_88101
UNITS mm
TOLERANCE LINEAR 0.1 mm ANGULAR 0.1 deg

# Principal dimensions from the calculation note.
PARAMETER hall_length 90000 mm
PARAMETER hall_width 47900 mm
PARAMETER bay_spacing 9000 mm
PARAMETER eave_height 12500 mm
PARAMETER ridge_height 17300 mm
PARAMETER ridge_x 23950 mm
PARAMETER left_base_height 2000 mm
PARAMETER right_base_height 7000 mm
PARAMETER left_column_length 10500 mm
PARAMETER right_column_length 5500 mm
PARAMETER roof_half_length 24426 mm
PARAMETER purlin_assumed_flange 80 mm
PARAMETER purlin_thickness 3 mm
ANGLE roof_pitch 11.332934 deg

# Repetition offsets for the eleven transverse portals and ten longitudinal bays.
POINT3 origin 0 mm 0 mm 0 mm
POINT3 frame_1 0 mm 9000 mm 0 mm
POINT3 frame_2 0 mm 18000 mm 0 mm
POINT3 frame_3 0 mm 27000 mm 0 mm
POINT3 frame_4 0 mm 36000 mm 0 mm
POINT3 frame_5 0 mm 45000 mm 0 mm
POINT3 frame_6 0 mm 54000 mm 0 mm
POINT3 frame_7 0 mm 63000 mm 0 mm
POINT3 frame_8 0 mm 72000 mm 0 mm
POINT3 frame_9 0 mm 81000 mm 0 mm
POINT3 frame_10 0 mm 90000 mm 0 mm

# Main member paths.
POINT3 left_column_start 0 mm 0 mm 2000 mm
POINT3 left_column_end 0 mm 0 mm 12500 mm
POINT3 right_column_start 47900 mm 0 mm 7000 mm
POINT3 right_column_end 47900 mm 0 mm 12500 mm
POINT3 ridge_start 23950 mm 0 mm 17300 mm
# Rafter centerline endpoints are trimmed so the swept IPE450 end envelopes
# meet, but do not penetrate, the IPE600 column faces and ridge splice plane.
POINT3 left_rafter_start 154.215 mm 0 mm 12530.9 mm
POINT3 left_rafter_end 23905.785 mm 0 mm 17291.14 mm
POINT3 right_rafter_start 23994.215 mm 0 mm 17291.14 mm
