POINT3 right_eave_beam_end 47900 mm 8700 mm 12500 mm
POINT3 ridge_beam_start 23950 mm 95 mm 17300 mm
POINT3 ridge_beam_end 23950 mm 8905 mm 17300 mm

# Roof purlin definition and line offsets. Roof-line elevation plus 350 mm seats
# the Z250 section above the IPE450 rafter rather than through its web.
