# Left S1 foundation: 4.4 x 3.5 x 0.8 m footing with a pedestal to the +2.0 m base.
BODY foundation_s1_left
MATERIAL concrete
SKETCH footing_plan ON PLANE XY
POINT a -2200 mm -1750 mm FIXED
POINT b 2200 mm -1750 mm FIXED
POINT c 2200 mm 1750 mm FIXED
POINT d -2200 mm 1750 mm FIXED
LINE ab FROM a TO b
LINE bc FROM b TO c
LINE cd FROM c TO d
LINE da FROM d TO a
END
PAD footing FROM footing_plan DEPTH 800 mm NEW
FEATURE pedestal
TYPE BOX
OPERATION UNION
WIDTH 1400 mm
DEPTH 1000 mm
HEIGHT 1160 mm
ORIGIN_X -700 mm
ORIGIN_Y -500 mm
ORIGIN_Z 800 mm
END
END

# Right S2 footing and pedestal follow the raised support datum shown in the note.
BODY foundation_s2_right
MATERIAL concrete
FEATURE footing
TYPE BOX
WIDTH 2100 mm
DEPTH 2500 mm
HEIGHT 500 mm
ORIGIN_X 46850 mm
ORIGIN_Y -1250 mm
END
FEATURE pedestal
TYPE BOX
OPERATION UNION
WIDTH 600 mm
DEPTH 600 mm
HEIGHT 6460 mm
ORIGIN_X 47600 mm
ORIGIN_Y -300 mm
ORIGIN_Z 500 mm
END
END

